  "body": "I would like to run a private Synapse server where users sign in with their Google account with OpenID Connect (OIDC).  I would like to only allow certain users to register, though, instead of allowing all users with a google account to sign up. For my particular case, it would even work to enable OIDC registration while I'm adding users, then disable registration through OIDC but still allow OIDC for sign in.\r\n\r\nIs this something that would be possible?\r\n",
